"Run its own code in pages" = "在页面中运行自己的代码";
"Safari extensions you get from the App Store show up here automatically. When you open a Chrome Web Store page, an orange “Add to Changmun” appears to the left of the address. Some features, such as talking to native apps, may not work." = "从 App Store 获取的 Safari 扩展会自动显示在这里。打开 Chrome 应用商店页面时，地址左侧会出现橙色的“添加到 Changmun”。与原生 App 通信等部分功能可能无法使用。";
"Search Bar" = "搜索栏";
"Search for a site and open it, then press ⌘D to add it to your favorites." = "搜索并打开一个网站，然后按 ⌘D 即可添加到个人收藏。";
"See and change cookies" = "查看和更改 Cookie";
"See and change what pages load" = "查看和更改页面加载的内容";
"See and change your bookmarks" = "查看和更改你的书签";
"See and change your browsing history" = "查看和更改你的浏览记录";
"See and manage your other extensions" = "查看和管理你的其他扩展";
"See the sites you visit most" = "查看你最常访问的网站";
"See the tabs you have open" = "查看你打开的标签页";
"See which pages you go to" = "查看你访问的页面";
"Show %lld more" = "再显示 %lld 个";
"Show fewer" = "收起";
"Show notifications" = "显示通知";
"Site data such as cookies and cache is removed too, which signs you out of sites." = "Cookie 和缓存等网站数据也会一并清除，这会使你退出网站登录。";
"Sites:\n%@" = "网站：\n%@";
"Start a New Chat" = "开始新对话";
"Start downloads and see your downloads" = "开始下载并查看你的下载项";
"Stop After This Browser" = "完成当前浏览器后停止";
"Stop the AI’s reply and start a new chat?" = "要停止 AI 的回复并开始新对话吗？";
"Stopping after this browser…" = "正在完成当前浏览器后停止…";
"Swipe with two fingers over the sidebar" = "在边栏上用两指轻扫";
"Switch space" = "切换空间";
"Tab Archive" = "标签页归档";
"Tabs are not brought back after an update restarts Changmun either." = "更新后 Changmun 重新启动时，也不会恢复标签页。";
"Tabs you haven’t looked at for that long are closed and kept in History › Archived Tabs, where you can reopen them. Favorites, bookmarks, and tabs that are playing, in use by the AI or using the camera or microphone stay open." = "超过该时间未查看的标签页会被关闭，并保存在历史记录 › 已归档的标签页中，你可以从那里重新打开。个人收藏、书签，以及正在播放、被 AI 使用或正在使用摄像头或麦克风的标签页会保持打开。";
"Takes known tracking parameters (utm_source, fbclid, gclid and the like) out of the addresses you type, open from a bookmark, open in a new tab or a Link Preview, or have the AI open. Links you click inside a page are left as the site wrote them. A site where it breaks a page has its own switch in the address bar." = "会从你输入的地址、从书签打开的地址、在新标签页或链接预览中打开的地址以及 AI 打开的地址中，去掉 utm_source、fbclid、gclid 等已知的跟踪参数。在页面里点击的链接保持网站原样。如果某个网站因此出现问题，可以在地址栏里单独为它关闭。";
"Talk to other apps on this Mac" = "与这台 Mac 上的其他 App 通信";
"The AI asks before anything risky." = "AI 在做有风险的事之前会先征求你的同意。";
"The reply that is running ends here, messages waiting to be sent are dropped, and the AI lets go of the tabs it was using." = "正在进行的回复会就此结束，等待发送的消息会被丢弃，AI 也会放开它正在使用的标签页。";
"The row at the bottom of the sidebar switches spaces." = "边栏底部的那一行用来切换空间。";
"This can't be stopped partway, so your library is never left half written." = "无法中途停止，因此你的资料库不会留下写到一半的内容。";
"This removes cookies, cache and other site data from that time, which signs you out of sites." = "这会清除该时间范围内的 Cookie、缓存和其他网站数据，并使你退出网站登录。";
"This removes the pages you visited, closed tabs and windows, and archived tabs from that time. Zoom levels you set for sites stay." = "这会清除该时间范围内访问过的页面、已关闭的标签页和窗口以及已归档的标签页。你为网站设置的缩放比例会保留。";
"This removes the pages you visited, closed tabs and windows, archived tabs and the zoom level you set for each site." = "这会清除访问过的页面、已关闭的标签页和窗口、已归档的标签页，以及你为每个网站设置的缩放比例。";
"Turn on “Check for updates automatically” to allow this." = "请先开启“自动检查更新”才能使用此选项。";
"Updates are not available in this copy of Changmun." = "这个 Changmun 无法使用更新功能。";
"Use the page you are viewing when you press its button" = "在你按下其按钮时使用你正在查看的页面";
"WebKit, which Changmun uses, does not support this extension. %@" = "Changmun 使用的 WebKit 不支持这个扩展。%@";
"What you type in the search bar is sent to your search engine to get suggestions. Nothing is sent in private windows." = "你在搜索栏中输入的内容会发送给搜索引擎以获取建议。在私密浏览窗口中不会发送任何内容。";
"You stopped the import, so the browsers after these were not imported." = "你已停止导入，因此之后的浏览器没有导入。";
"⇧-click" = "⇧-点按";
"⇧⌘-click" = "⇧⌘-点按";
"⌘-click or middle-click" = "⌘-点按或鼠标中键点按";
"⌘L searches and goes anywhere." = "⌘L 可以搜索并前往任何地方。";
"⌘Return in the search field" = "在搜索栏中按 ⌘Return";
"⌘T opens the search bar over a blank page." = "按 ⌘T 会在空白页上方显示搜索栏。";

