"This page has a password or payment field, so it isn’t sent to Claude, and this Mac can’t translate it: that needs macOS 26 or later." = "此页面含有密码栏或支付栏，所以没有发送给 Claude，这台 Mac 也无法翻译它：需要 macOS 26 或更高版本。";
"Keep translating this site" = "持续翻译此网站";
"Translates this site’s pages as they open, and the text they add later. With Claude, the text of each page is sent to Anthropic automatically, without asking again." = "打开此网站的页面时自动翻译，之后新增的文字也会翻译。使用 Claude 时，每个页面的文字会自动发送给 Anthropic，不再询问。";
"Type an engine’s keyword and then what you want to find in the address bar to search with it. Engines you add get no search suggestions." = "在地址栏中先输入搜索引擎的关键词，再输入想查找的内容，即可用该引擎搜索。添加的搜索引擎没有搜索建议。";
"Sites you turned “Keep translating this site” on for stay here. Their pages are translated as they open. With Claude, the text of each of those pages is sent to Anthropic automatically." = "已开启“持续翻译此网站”的网站会保留在这里。它们的页面在打开时自动翻译。使用 Claude 时，这些页面的文字会自动发送给 Anthropic。";
"Kept translating" = "持续翻译";
"Keyword" = "关键词";
